# Virtual Environments
.venv/
venv/
ENV/
env/

# Environment Variables
# Ignore every .env variant and re-admit the documented template, so a new
# deployment-specific file (.env.azure, .env.containerapps) cannot be committed
# by accident.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

